{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AObtQwlQSe1794610369.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價經過上日急挫後回穩。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報3,886.3美元一盎司，升1美元，升幅百分之0.02。</p><p></p><p>金價經過上日跌百分之3，並見超過一年低位後回穩，收市報3,884.49美元一盎司，升7.42美元，升幅近百分之0.2。</p><p></p><p>美國聯儲局下月加息機會升溫，利率期貨市場預期，下月有八成九機會加息四分之一厘，加息半厘的機會約一成一。而根據《路透》調查，經濟學家普遍相信，歐洲央行下月將加息。不利沒有利率回報的黃金價格。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.736406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:09.237504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:19.023933+00:00","content_hash":"2031e5eaa09b55ac4e9bf448cf2d425822d7d371d7fa9ca587737a1976d8668a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.736406+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}